  "excerpt": "<form class=\"group add\" id=\"sign-in-claude-form\" data-sign-in-form data-sign-in-kind=\"claude\" data-sign-in-steps=\"Open the sign-in and approve. Anthropic then shows a code: copy all of it (it holds a #) into the field, then Finish.\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-labelledby=\"sign-in-claude-title\"> <div class=\"row\"><div><div class=\"row-title\"><h3 id=\"sign-in-claude-title\">Sign in with Claude</h3></div><p class=\"desc\">Use your Claude Pro or Max plan&#39;s usage for Pi Durable, on Anthropic&#39;s Messages API. Start, open the link and approve, then paste what it gives you back here.</p> <div class=\"callout callout-warn\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#i-warn\"/></svg><div><strong>Your risk</strong><p>This signs in as Claude Code, with its OAuth client, as pi-ai does. Anthropic&#39;s terms may not allow a Claude plan&#39;s usage outside its own apps: that risk is yours, chosen knowingly. It needs a Claude Pro or Max plan. Anthropic offers no revocation to apps, so signing out here does not end the grant: remove it at claude.ai, under Settings, Claude Code.</p></div></div></div></div> <div class=\"form-body\"> <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"sign-in-claude-id\">Id</label><input id=\"sign-in-claude-id\" name=\"id\" type=\"text\" required pattern=\"[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9\\-]{0,30}[a-z0-9])?\" value=\"claude\" autocapitalize=\"none\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div> <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"sign-in-claude-label\">Label</label><input id=\"sign-in-claude-label\" name=\"label\" type=\"text\" maxlength=\"60\" value=\"Claude\"></div> <div class=\"field wide\" data-sign-in-step hidden><p class=\"desc\"><a data-sign-in-link target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" hidden>Open the Claude sign-in</a></p><label for=\"sign-in-claude-paste\">What the sign-in gave you</label><textarea id=\"sign-in-claude-paste\" name=\"pasted\" rows=\"3\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"code#state\"></textarea><p class=\"hint\">It holds a one-time code: paste it here only.</p></div> </div> <div class=\"form-foot\"><p data-sign-in-note aria-live=\"polite\"></p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-sign-in-start>Start sign-in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-sign-in-finish>Finish sign-in</button></div> </form>"
